.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1739445/000173944526000067/0001739445-26-000067-index.htm","accession":"0001739445-26-000067"},{"text":"Net cash of $153.2m against total assets of $5.0bn - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1739445/000173944526000067/0001739445-26-000067-index.htm","accession":"0001739445-26-000067"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (0.0% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1739445/000173944526000067/0001739445-26-000067-index.htm","accession":"0001739445-26-000067"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue grew only 4.4% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in sales.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1739445/000173944526000067/0001739445-26-000067-index.htm","accession":"0001739445-26-000067"},{"text":"Gross margin is only 21.1%, so scale has to be enormous before anything reaches the bottom line.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1739445/000173944526000067/0001739445-26-000067-index.htm","accession":"0001739445-26-000067"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.8% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1739445/000173944526000118/0001739445-26-000118-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 13.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","threshold":0.13,"consecutive":2,"current":0.211,"current_display":"21.1%","threshold